Stage 1 of 8: Your First Minutes

A short tutorial starts automatically for new characters and teaches
looking, moving, gear, and safe combat. Darkflow shows it in a hover
window. Type "tutorial" to see your current step and "tutorial continue"
to continue in any client.

Learn to look at things with "look <thing>", check your "inventory", and read
your "score". If you get lost, "ncot" returns you to the Center of
Town, where the Newbie Tome Dispenser (pull lever, read tome) holds the
town directions.

Screenreader mode intentionally keeps visual-only detail and monitor
settings quiet. Use "set list" to review your saved options. If screenreader
mode is not already enabled, run "set screenreader on" to enable
screenreader-friendly output.

Read: help tutorial, help basics, help movement, help new, help set,
help screenreader.
